 # Clips Kitty: the free, open-source Opus Clip alternative for chatting, gaming and sports, on your own PC
 
+> **Desktop editor workflow.** Use **Import videos** on the Dashboard to add a video file
+> or a YouTube, Twitch, or Kick URL. Each import keeps the full source for manual trimming
+> in **Clip Editor**. Layouts, captions, and export are available for imported videos and
+> existing clips. The rest of this README describes the upstream release.
+
